<title>UK: HORSE RACING-MR MULLIGAN WINS CHELTENHAM GOLD CUP.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-MR MULLIGAN WINS CHELTENHAM GOLD CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CHELTENHAM, England 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mr Mulligan, ridden by Tony McCoy, won the Cheltenham Gold Cup horse race on Thursday.</p>
